---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="机场选购指南 - 如何挑选最适合自己的翻墙机场" 
  description="详细的机场选购避坑指南，从套餐价格、线路质量、流媒体解锁、客户端支持及售后服务等多维度，教您如何挑选高性价比的翻墙机场。"
>
  <div class="page-shell guide-page">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <h1>选购机场防坑指南</h1>
      <p>市面上的翻墙机场多如牛毛，质量参差不齐。为了帮您避开“跑路”和“劣质”机场，我们整理了这套多维度的选购标准，让您的每一分钱都花在刀刃上。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="guide-grid">
      <!-- Card 1: 节点覆盖与线路质量 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>节点覆盖与线路质量</h2>
        <p>高性价比机场通常在香港、日本、新加坡和美国等地部署节点。优质机场会提供 CN2 GIA、BGP 优化或 IPLC/IEPL 专线通道，这直接决定了您在晚高峰时段的网络体验。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            IPLC / IEPL 专线最稳定，无视封锁
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            BGP 优化线路性价比高，适合日常
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            CN2 GIA 延迟极低，非常适合游戏
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: 套餐与价格 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>套餐与价格策略</h2>
        <p>常见的付费模式包括月付、季付、年付以及按流量计费的不限时套餐。年付套餐通常折扣更高，但首次使用陌生机场风险较大，建议先选择提供试用或短期体验的套餐。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            新机场强烈建议“先月付后年付”
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            优先考虑有试用或退款保障的商家
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            关注五一、双十一等重大节假日优惠
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: 流媒体与 AI 解锁 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>流媒体与 AI 解锁</h2>
        <p>部分用户选择机场是为了访问海外流媒体和 AI 服务，如 Netflix、Disney+、ChatGPT、Midjourney 等。如果节点 IP 被封锁频繁，或者原生 IP 不足，使用体验会大打折扣。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            确认 Netflix 和 Disney+ 原生解锁能力
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            验证 ChatGPT 与 Claude 的可用性
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            检查冷门地区（如土耳其/阿根廷）节点
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: 协议与客户端支持 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>协议与客户端兼容</h2>
        <p>不同机场可能支持 V2Ray、Trojan、Shadowsocks 或 Hysteria，客户端兼容性直接决定了使用的便捷程度。好的机场应该支持市面上所有主流的第三方代理软件。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            完美兼容 Clash (Windows/Mac) / V2RayN
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            提供 iOS 客户端共享账号 (Shadowrocket)
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            拥有官方自研的“一键客户端”体验最佳
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: 售后与口碑 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>售后服务与口碑</h2>
        <p>高性价比不只是便宜，还包括商家的服务态度、技术实力和社区活跃度。可以通过官方公告、Telegram 群组、论坛等渠道了解机场的维护频率和客服响应效率。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            观察 Telegram 官方群组的活跃度与氛围
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            关注节点日常故障后的修复速度与公告
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            了解工单系统的回复速度与态度
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: 隐私与安全 -->
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="gc-icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h2>隐私与支付安全</h2>
        <p>翻墙本身带有一定的隐蔽需求，优质的机场不会过度收集用户的个人隐私数据，并且会提供相对匿名和安全的支付方式，保障用户在使用过程中的隐私权益。</p>
        <ul class="gc-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            支持 USDT 等加密货币匿名支付
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            注册免实名认证，仅需邮箱即可
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            拥有清晰的“无日志记录 (No-Log)”政策
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style is:inline>
    .guide-page {
      padding-top: 60px;
      padding-bottom: 80px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .guide-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .guide-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .guide-header p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .guide-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .guide-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .guide-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.08);
      border-color: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.2);
    }

    .gc-icon-wrapper {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c, #f97316);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.3);
    }
    .gc-icon-wrapper svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
    }

    .guide-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .guide-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .gc-checklist {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }
    .gc-checklist li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .gc-checklist li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .check-icon {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      color: #10b981;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .guide-header h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .guide-header p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }
      .guide-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }
      .guide-card {
        padding: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
